@startuml deployment
title Deployment Diagram — Mahotsav

node "Client Device" {
  artifact "Web Browser" as Browser {
    component "React SPA bundle\n(dist/ from Vite build)" as Bundle
  }
}

node "Web / Static Host" as WebHost {
  artifact "Static assets\n(index.html, JS, CSS)" as Static
}

node "Application Server\n(Node.js runtime)" as AppServer {
  component "Express API\n(server/src/index.js)\nPORT 5000" as API
  folder "uploads/\n(templates, images)" as Uploads
}

node "Database Server" as DbServer {
  database "MySQL" as MySQL
}

cloud "Resend\n(Email SaaS)" as Resend

Browser --> Static : HTTPS (load SPA)
Bundle --> API : HTTPS REST\n/api/* (Bearer JWT)
API --> MySQL : TCP 3306\n(mysql2 / Drizzle)
API --> Uploads : read/write files
API --> Resend : HTTPS (API key)

note right of AppServer
  Dev: Vite dev server :5173 proxies to API :5000.
  Prod: SPA served statically; API behind same origin / reverse proxy.
  Secrets via .env (JWT_SECRET, DATABASE_URL, RESEND_API_KEY).
end note
@enduml
